---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
---
<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" updated="2026-05-05">
  <p>
    EdgeSecura (“we”, “us”) provides external identity lifecycle management to
    business customers (“Customer”). This Privacy Policy explains how we
    collect, use, and safeguard personal data when you visit our website and
    when our Customers use the EdgeSecura service.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Data we collect</h2>
  <h3>1.1 From visitors to this website</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Pages requested, referring URL, approximate location derived from IP.</li>
    <li>Information you submit through demo and contact forms.</li>
  </ul>
  <h3>1.2 From users of the EdgeSecura service</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Account identifiers, role membership, and audit events generated by your activity.</li>
    <li>Customer-provided data about external identities (contractors, partners, vendors).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. How we use data</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To provide and secure the service.</li>
    <li>To meet our legal and contractual obligations to Customers.</li>
    <li>To improve product reliability through aggregated, de-identified telemetry.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Legal basis (GDPR)</h2>
  <p>
    For Customer data, EdgeSecura acts as a data Processor under the Customer’s
    Data Processing Agreement (see our <a href="/dpa">DPA</a>). For website
    visitors, we rely on legitimate interest and, where required, consent.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Data retention</h2>
  <p>
    Customer data is retained for the term of the agreement plus the
    contractually agreed deletion window. Marketing-form submissions are
    retained for up to 24 months.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Sub-processors</h2>
  <p>
    We use a limited set of vetted sub-processors for hosting, observability,
    and customer support. The current list is published at
    <a href="/subprocessors">edgesecura.com/subprocessors</a> and updated with
    30 days’ notice before a new sub-processor is added.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on your jurisdiction you may have the right to access, correct,
    delete, or port your personal data. To exercise these rights contact
    <a href="mailto:privacy@edgesecura.com">privacy@edgesecura.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    EdgeSecura — Data Protection Officer<br />
    <a href="mailto:privacy@edgesecura.com">privacy@edgesecura.com</a>
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
